      "message": "They are NOT enforcing 16k page size for the smartphones, rather they are enforcing 16k page size support for new apps submitted to the play store (also because it would require a format data for their current devices which use f2fs for /data).\n\n\u003e Starting November 1st, 2025, all new apps and updates to existing apps submitted to Google Play and targeting Android 15+ devices must support 16 KB page sizes.\n\nhttps://android-developers.googleblog.com/2025/05/prepare-play-apps-for-devices-with-16kb-page-size.html",
